GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: school-example-16

### createGroup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/groups
