Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Theory group",
  "branchId": null,
  "categoryCode": null
}

### getGroup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: school-example-18

### renameGroup
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/groups/{{groupId}}/name
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: school-example-19
Idempotency-Key: 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019
Content-Type: application/json

