### Expected 404: unknown branch within an authorized school
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/branches/ffffffff-ffff-4fff-8fff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Expected 400: missing required role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetUserId":"{{targetUserId}}"}

### Retained activation outcome (use the original command UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/activation-operations/30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000050
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Platform operator abort before School local commit; keep protection until acknowledgement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/activation-operations/30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000050/abort
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Operator reviewed and withdrew this pending intent"}
